- High risk: follow SDD `delivery_strategy` +óÔé¼ÔÇØ ask on `ask-on-risk`, auto-slice on `auto-chain`, require `size:exception` on over-budget `single-pr`, or record accepted `size:exception` on `exception-ok`.
